{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact: <a href=\"mailto:573021751@qq.com\">573021751@qq.com</a></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three months ago, a three-person team ventured deep into <strong>the Pit 3</strong> and lost contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar office, receiving a long-delayed distress message. With only a gun and an old, outdated cellphone by your side, there's no way out\u2014you have no choice but to grit your teeth and head deeper down, searching for the missing team. In the darkness, you catch a glimpse of purple.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/bc9e74465acd64e864888a9ebb9a4ee1.poster.avif?t=1759930617\" width=500 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/bc9e74465acd64e864888a9ebb9a4ee1.webm?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/bc9e74465acd64e864888a9ebb9a4ee1.mp4?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pull Out Your Phone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can pull out your phone at any time to do all sorts of things \u2014 check messages, listen to music, make calls, or even play games! Even when there\u2019s no signal underground, you can still fiddle with your phone and waste your life away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/15157e91b4b5a43aa3c922d4299c691b.poster.avif?t=1759930617\" width=500 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/15157e91b4b5a43aa3c922d4299c691b.webm?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/15157e91b4b5a43aa3c922d4299c691b.mp4?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Searching for Survivors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most people have already passed away since the accident. Every lucky person left in this pit can provide you with great assistance, even if they are no longer human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/2bea5bad0aa178bf5c0acb42d7b118a0.poster.avif?t=1759930617\" width=480 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/2bea5bad0aa178bf5c0acb42d7b118a0.webm?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/2bea5bad0aa178bf5c0acb42d7b118a0.mp4?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2412120?t=1759930617","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2412120?t=1759930617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/05cce873872d4a61d048b69fc2f974e43a32d03a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759930617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/05cce873872d4a61d048b69fc2f974e43a32d03a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759930617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description