57e91b4b5a43aa3c922d4299c691b.webm?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/15157e91b4b5a43aa3c922d4299c691b.mp4?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Searching for Survivors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most people have already passed away since the accident. Every lucky person left in this pit can provide you with great assistance, even if they are no longer human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/2bea5bad0aa178bf5c0acb42d7b118a0.poster.avif?t=1759930617\" width=480 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/2bea5bad0aa178bf5c0acb42d7b118a0.webm?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/extras/2bea5bad0aa178bf5c0acb42d7b118a0.mp4?t=1759930617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["KUSOftware","Bite Cake Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412120/f5e8e976bd62f91f887299c874a04e71413ea70b/header.jpg?t=1759930617","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u4e09\u53f7\u5751","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6320 (2*1866) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></